          {
            "url": "https://www.forbes.com/sites/kenrapoza/2018/12/17/chinas-new-growing-pains-not-all-because-of-trade-war/",
            "title": "China's New Growing Pains Not All Due To Trump's Trade War",
            "snippets": [
              "China won't be able to stimulate its economy as before. Regulatory rollbacks and more loans to come in 2019.\nMoney",
